			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I am posting this topic out of the request of one of our most respected officers whom I have spoken too about the issue. I recently purchased another character to box with my shaman and ultimately to play the class as well to avoid all the lower level leveling. I had been scouting for a sk for sometime now but nothing turned up till the other night. I spoke many times with the owner on the phone and whatnot and was informed it was a pking character. I knew beforehand it was a character with a pk history but I did not know who (for safety reasons for original owner), but I bought the account anyway because I did not know when a sk account would come up again. The shadowknight's name turned out to be Handguns whom I had never heard of since he is in 50s but evidently a bunch of others had. It does not show in the Adepts Rallos player history site but he was also in Population Control. I was also told to show proof of purchasing so heres the link to that auction 
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://www.playerauctions.com/listings/details/index.cfm?itemnum=1090604050" target="_blank">http://www.playerauctions.com/listings/details/index.cfm?itemnum=1090604050</a> 
<br />

<br />
I have already laid down my hard earned money for the account and fully intend on cleaning his rep. I have been grouping with Dhof, Fusion and other members with him already and have had no conflicts but I spoke up about it to an officer anyways so that he could hopefully enter CotW at you guys discretion. I was told it was the recruit councils decision ultimately to whether or not he is able to enter cotw and join the family and I will agree on whatever decision you guys make. I will also state that any guilds reading this that have had problems with the guy in the past are welcome to send me a tell to try and work out any problems they may have had. I'm also asking for opinions of course lol 
<br />

<br />
Thanks for everyones time and see you in game as usual.<div style="vertical-align: bottom"><br /><br /><br />_________________<br />Nairr has risen...in Ogre form
<br />

<br />
Zugshamanx
